  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "1c0fadba-3ea8-4f51-b805-407b0f53be5e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        128,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## GDPR Contact Enricher\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow periodically pulls pending GDPR contact enrichment requests from Airtable and processes them one request at a time. For each request, it searches the web with Tavily, filters results by confidence, uses OpenAI to extract people, enriches the resulting contacts through Dropcontact, then writes contacts back to Airtable and marks the request complete. Requests without usable search evidence are marked as low-confidence instead of being enriched.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Airtable credentials and verify the pending requests, contacts, completion, and low-confidence status fields match the node mappings.\n- Add credentials or API keys for Tavily, OpenAI, and Dropcontact in the relevant HTTP/OpenAI/Dropcontact nodes.\n- Run the manual webhook setup branch once to register the Dropcontact callback URL, and ensure the Wait node/webhook URL is reachable from Dropcontact.\n- Review the schedule trigger interval and enable the workflow after testing with a small batch of pending requests.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the Tavily query parameters, confidence threshold code, OpenAI extraction prompt, Dropcontact payload formatting, and Airtable field mappings to match the target market, data model, and GDPR review process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3e69a8b4-49a8-4ab3-9a6d-122c754acf92",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2144,
        848
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Webhook setup utility\n\nA separate manual branch used to register the Dropcontact webhook before the automated enrichment flow runs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a175ee0c-207d-4256-9f94-5cf7dd1ffd16",
